    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the appeal court renders its decision on an appeal` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where the appeal court renders its decision on an appeal"
        IF NOT `it is the summary conviction court from which the appeal was taken or a justice exercising the same jurisdiction` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "the summary conviction court from which the appeal was taken or a justice exercising the same jurisdiction"
        IF NOT `the conviction, order or determination has been affirmed, modified or made by the appeal court` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a conviction, order or determination that has been affirmed, modified or made by the appeal court"
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

